// Dialog :
"P2777473596" "You have retrieved the crystal that should restore Crash to her old self."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3475131555" "The crystal? No! Nooo! Don't bring it any nearer; you'll disrupt the -- <br><br>Well, that's better. Thanks, {VillainName}. Thanks a million. I guess I got in a little over my head with the Circle. I thought they just wanted me to help them get an in with Cage Consortium, but they were far more devious than I expected! They wanted me to go back to work for my dad, and I wouldn't do it. So they nearly changed me forever! They probably would have done the same to you, given the chance. I'm glad you didn't give it to them. <br><br>The good thing is, the Circle's done a lot of damage to Cage Consortium, and I can take the credit for that! Maybe this'll make my dad respect me at last!"
// RandomFameString :
"P890946474" "I hear {VillainName} isn't afraid to stand up to the Circle!"

